  "card": "Moves the getblocktemplate RPC cache from function-local static variables into BlockTemplateManager. This eliminates process-wide global state where dangling CBlockIndex pointers could outlive ChainstateManager across tests, introduces Clang thread-safety annotations under cs_main, and adds unit test coverage for template rebuild and retry rules. The change addresses the getblocktemplate global state removal tracked in issue #33758 and serves as the base for PR #36922.",
